dates go_functions v1
description "Two dates whose aliases differ only in an underscore. Go names a function in PascalCase, so both are Net30 there, and the Go code does not compile (W001). Every other target takes them as they are"

inputs
  received : date  range >=2026-01-01 <=2026-01-31

date net_30 = received
  + 30 days

date net30 = received
  close end of month
  + 30 days
